==Battleground==
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] will make this stage and its Dark enemies a cakewalk, while the Zombies can be countered using [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] and/or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]]. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl/Pizza Cat]] are especially useful when dealing with the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Darks]] as well.

